<Slide style={{ padding: '22px 64px 18px 64px', background: '#F7F4EC' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 102, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>第 2 步 · /login 打开服务商列表</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.72)', marginTop: 6 }}>在输入框敲 /login 回车。列表里一眼能看出哪些已经登录过、用的是哪种凭据</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ padding: '10px 18px', background: '#1D1B16', borderRadius: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B8730F' }}>选中后回车确认</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 534, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 273, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Image src="assets/omp_slash.png" style={{ width: 946, height: 273, borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)' }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 245, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 18, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 11, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16' }}>① 敲 / 会自动补全</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.78)', lineHeight: 1.62, marginTop: 10 }}>输入框下方会实时列出可用命令。login 就是登录服务商，按回车进入下一步。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 18, background: '#FFFFFF', borderRadius: 11, border: '1px solid rgba(29,27,22,0.10)', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1D1B16' }}>② 列表里的状态标记</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.78)', lineHeight: 1.62, marginTop: 10 }}>没登录过的只显示名字；已经登录过的会跟上绿色标记，并写明凭据来源，例如 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>logged in (api key)</span>。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: 18, background: 'rgba(184,115,15,0.10)', borderRadius: 11, border: '1px solid rgba(184,115,15,0.42)', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8A5608' }}>③ 找不到就搜</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.80)', lineHeight: 1.62, marginTop: 10 }}>列表很长（十几家服务商）。不用往下翻，直接打字就能过滤 —— 下一页就演示搜 DeepSeek。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 44, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.48)' }}>方向键上下移动，Esc 退回输入框</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(29,27,22,0.48)' }}>09 / 40</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
